{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0293_1000_p", "source_sha256": "71bada526b2fc4332166626ea4eab7a15c58547192bfea749243d29d3d8bd7e9", "ja": "（外回り中に少しだけ時間が空いたので、\n何気なく公園に足を向けた……）", "zh": "（外出办事期间空出了一点时间，便不经意间走向了公园……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0293_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "6c63d680ec1df193200e08fb15f41d5284f91bea126ac33d95ca10ab72f77778", "ja": "あっ、仕掛け人さま！？", "zh": "啊，幕后掌门人大人！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0293_1002_p", "source_sha256": "101b8230e57f9f1016070e01845b4754bd60be06aa8fe552409b301fa7c8bff4", "ja": "あれ？　エミリー、お疲れさま。\nエミリーも散歩中か？", "zh": "哎？艾米莉，辛苦了。\n艾米莉也是在散步吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0293_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "acb3e64652b35bde63890458747ee54e08d737e40ff9ff404107276447ee56c2", "ja": "はい♪　こうして外で偶然お会いできると、\nなんだか嬉しくなってしまいますね……えへへ。", "zh": "是的♪能像这样在外面偶然遇见您，总觉得让人很开心……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0293_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d74e985ada15104beea3909db96075c68eb56ecbc896c6a51f77a4f1d62950d6", "ja": "うん、なんだか特別な感じがするよな。\nよかったら一緒に、少し歩こうか？", "zh": "嗯，总觉得有一种特别的感觉呢。\n方便的话，要不要一起稍微走走？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0293_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "b288912953e113b5d622afadb83c627fad578e75daa13d21db1ce60c65e4f0f4", "ja": "もちろんです♪　では、まいりましょう！", "zh": "当然♪那我们走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0293_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "a9b47a309eb54c33419c504d86f2393fd38341cd88f24d85f304da19470517c3", "ja": "この辺りはもう満開ですね！\nとても綺麗です……はぁ。", "zh": "这一带的花已经盛开了呢！\n真是漂亮……哈啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0293_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "3656acb382faf8a1167e1cdc2baf198b90b65cf80b3b36703d1caefd43b2a460", "ja": "風が、花の色に染まって……。\n桜だけではなく、草木の緑も深いですね！", "zh": "风染上了花朵的色彩……\n不只是樱花，连草木的绿色也变得更加浓郁了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0293_1008_p", "source_sha256": "dbd080bc28d1effc82c283b259a47abfde9bc31f0566563bb5ca248f3b690f81", "ja": "ああ。のんびり歩くのには、いい季節だな。\nまさに春の風物詩って感じだ。", "zh": "啊，正是适合悠闲散步的季节啊。\n简直就是春天的风物诗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0293_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "08bf68c0be2dedda162a5e65031dc0886987bbeb5311b35ff932680a7908c92f", "ja": "ふふ♪　春の風物詩と言えば……撮影で訪れた\n菜の花畑も、とても綺麗でしたね！", "zh": "呵呵♪说到春天的风物诗……之前去拍摄的油菜花田，也非常漂亮呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0293_1010_p", "source_sha256": "d715e7fe22291a963dbe1fdee206e3352d538ff84e0a1490a8f0c357433e23ee", "ja": "ああ、エミリーのグラビア撮影で行ったっけ……。\nあれも確かに綺麗だった。", "zh": "啊，说到艾米莉拍摄写真时去过的地方……那片油菜花田也确实很美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0293_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "d7b6b6ac6c6ed6209dd043de17b4a1bdde4c71b92561a9a1749af44d674f5f4d", "ja": "はい！　とても印象に残っているんです。\n故郷のことを思い出してしまって……。", "zh": "是的！我印象非常深刻。\n不禁让我想起了故乡……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0293_1012_p", "source_sha256": "63a0462b170b2d0f7eacd4aafa7c1062e43aeeca1d51e97eda1a25e2520fbc41", "ja": "確か、イギリスの菜の花畑は\n有名なんだよな。聞いたことある気がするよ。", "zh": "对了，英国的油菜花田好像很有名。我好像听说过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0293_1013_032emi", "source_sha256": "ed74a898740075d76741e779c6131a49ac2626d12c6e7c9903c1336e6d3a47c2", "ja": "そうなんです！　見渡す限り、一面の金色で……。\nいつか、劇場のみなさんにも見てもらいたいです！", "zh": "没错！放眼望去，尽是一片金色……。\n真希望哪天也能让剧场的大家看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0293_1014_p", "source_sha256": "97c7d4e9a1f405a96e6b83a00772bb57ada5c1c961efb17f10c94d0c43f2217e", "ja": "そうだな……。\nみんなでイギリスに公演しに行くのも、よさそうだ。", "zh": "是啊……\n大家一起去英国演出，似乎也不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0293_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "5619109b0b8eb77c2e56be880b31b77162cbe433614c82e7d2baff0867543cf0", "ja": "Wow！　英国公演ですか！？\nとても素敵な計画ですね♪", "zh": "Wow！　是英国演出吗！？\n真是非常美妙的计划呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0293_1016_p", "source_sha256": "6f11fff092aab400035d1ffef41a0395f869372a31e237e983005b87a183abbf", "ja": "まあ、まだ具体的な話じゃないけど。", "zh": "不过，目前还只是个大概的想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0293_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "274657b90a0440b4ef48f88a84e587ed88b4e0782f97dbd15bbc60d2d2325601", "ja": "はい、いつか叶うように……。\n大和撫子として、精進を重ねてまいりますね！", "zh": "是的，为了有朝一日能够实现……  \n我会以大和抚子的标准不断精进！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
